+#
+# Design analysis for the combo variant
+# -------------------------------------
+# spec adaptation:
+#   grid:
+#     size: 18-28 square
+#     bg: one uniform color, never equal to body or marker colors
+#   active prototypes:
+#     count: exactly 2
